# API and persistence

- Prefix is `/api/v1`. No auth. Routers stay thin; DB and file I/O stay in `pjtracker.app`.
- New document types follow parse-preview (no save) → create (multipart) → JSON patches → dedicated download routes.
- `fiscal_mes` is `YYYY-MM`. Do not expose filesystem `pdf_path` as the way to fetch files.
- Completeness rules live in `api/services/fiscal_months.py` (required NF/boleto/DARF/extrato counts; IRPJ/CSLL on quarter-end months).
- Tests: temp DB/pdf/image dirs (see `tests/test_api.py`). Mock parsers; do not call Maritaca or EasyOCR.
- Do not add features to the Streamlit app.
